ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nHua Hua and Li Li are good friends of Yi Jia. Today, they decide to visit the sick Yi Jia in the hospital. They do not tell Yi Jia in advance before they go. When Hua Hua and Li Li arrive at the hospital, they see Yi Jia sitting on a chair in the hospital room, seemingly crying. Hua Hua enters the room first and waves to Yi Jia. Seeing that Yi Jia's reaction is a bit hesitant, Hua Hua gives Li Li a look, then smiles at Yi Jia. Li Li looks at Hua Hua, then looks at Yi Jia, and decides to wait in the corridor.\n\n[Question]\nWhat do you think Yi Jia is thinking?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Yi Jia feels surprised by the arrival of Hua Hua and Li Li, she may want to be alone for a while.\nB. Yi Jia feels angry, she does not like these two friends coming to see her without telling her in advance.\nC. Yi Jia feels puzzled about the arrival of Hua Hua and Li Li, she does not know why they come.\nD. Yi Jia feels happy about the arrival of Hua Hua and Li Li, she hopes they can accompany her.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021826488784931525,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1bcd6006945d28004ea","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367932424,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6be9d02b2abf4999a7152c7d51b63d32"}